en operating margins and free cash flow generation.\",[[0,39,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Regulatory \\u0026 Orbital Congestion Bottlenecks: Tightened FAA environmental reviews, FCC spectrum allocation disputes, and international resistance regarding space debris and low-Earth-orbit saturation could slow launch cadences.\",[[0,44,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]],[[[null,[null,0,\"Multiples Compression: If revenue growth decelerates or broader macroeconomic/tech multiples contract, an equity story trading well above historical aerospace multiples faces sharp multiple contraction\",[[0,22,[[null,null,null,null,2]]]]]]]]],1]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"3.8 Flash\",true,[[[[1004,\"Longer\",5,null,[\"expand\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/expand/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1005,\"Shorter\",6,null,[\"compress\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/compress/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1002,\"Don't personalize\",2,null,[\"person_cancel\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/person_cancel/default/24px.svg\",null,true]],[1001,\"Try again\",1,null,[\"refresh\",\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/i/short-term/release/googlesymbols/refresh/default/24px.svg\",null,true]]]]],null,2,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,1]"]]
